<title>GERMANY: West German Ifo business index 92.4 vs 93.6 - Ifo.</title>
<headline>West German Ifo business index 92.4 vs 93.6 - Ifo.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German Ifo economics institute gave the following data from its February business climate survey:</p>
<p>    West Germany		    March 1997	February 1997</p>
<p>     Business climate		  92.4		 93.6</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     82.8		 84.4</p>
<p>     Business expectations	   103.2	     104.1</p>
<p>    East Germany		    March 1997	February 1997</p>
<p>     Business climate		  104.1		104.1</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     120.1		119.7</p>
<p>     Business expectations	   90.0		  90.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Market forecasts for the west German business climate index averaged 94.0.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
